 "notes": "Merged: Wet-shaving kit into Double-edge safety razor as a type; DE and SE blades into Safety razor blade; Razor cartridge into Cartridge razor as a type. Old models without a confirmable archetype stay in m (Schick Krona/Platinum, Lady Gillette, Souplex, Wardonia, Dovo/Merkur/Shark blades). Left out: Gillette Tech exact launch is from vintage-razor.com (1938); no page retrieved linking Wardonia to Gillette, so not made a version; Solingen tradition not repeated (already in shelf 03_01); Feather brand register entry not repeated (in 03_01). Leaf placed under single-edge (uses single-edge blades). No founding years for Merkur, Edwin Jagger, Rockwell, OneBlade, Leaf (not on retrieved pages). Gillette Fusion ProGlide range from old data kept as a Fusion version."
